HB0236 County officials-nonpartisan elections.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Chestek, Brown, L, Harshman and Yin
and Senator(s) Cooper and Rothfuss
AN ACT relating to elections; providing for the nonpartisan nomination and
election of candidates for specified county elected offices; modifying the
procedure to fill vacancies for nonpartisan county elected offices; providing
for the order of offices on nonpartisan election ballots; specifying the form
of election ballots; making conforming amendments; repealing a conflicting
provision; and providing for an effective date.
